          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Add the following property runes to the list you can choose for your blessed armament: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Animated], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Fearsome (Greater)]{Greater Fearsome}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Grievous], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Keen], and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Vitalizing (Greater)]{Greater Vitalizing}. If you have the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Radiant Armament] feat, add greater @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Astral (Greater)]{Greater Astral} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Brilliant (Greater)]{Greater Brilliant} to the list as well.</p>\n<p>In addition, you can change the rune you've selected for the day to a different rune from your list as a single action that has the concentrate and divine traits. Changing the rune doesn't restore abilities that can be used only a limited number of times.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Blessed Armament]</p>"
